# The developer test suite. It is a build-time tool, not part of the product —
# nobody running FreeITSM has any use for it, and the Dockerfile's `COPY . ` was
# otherwise putting 55 scripts that write to the real database into the web root
# of the official image. Every one of them now refuses unless PHP_SAPI is 'cli',
# but the cheapest defence is not shipping them at all.
tests/
